      <activity id="9be9932a-6b1b-50b7-ade1-ed01b604869a" activityNameId="3521473f-6ae4-5a81-bcbb-56bd848d9d3c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">ITO, sintered target, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: ITO, sintered target, at plant
This module relates to 1 kg ITO net bound to a backplate. It comprises the forming of a high-density sintered body from ITO and its attachment to a copper backplate. Dimensions assumed: 610mm x 350mm. No direct process emissions are considered due to a lack of respective information.\nTechnology: Pressing at 250 Mpa, sintering at 1'500°C for 3h. Soldering with Indium to backplate\nVersion: 2.2\nSynonyms: Indium Tin Oxide, Indium Zinn Oxid, sputtering target\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Elektronik\nLocal subcategory: Modul\nUVEK 2022 source file:10146.XML\n\n
Synonyms: Indium Tin Oxide, Indium Zinn Oxid, sputtering target; 
UUID: 29569a22-72d9-3125-ba0d-ac7cf79adc1e
Production of nanoscaled powder, sintering, bonding, and production of backplate.
Location: undefined
Technology: Pressing at 250 Mpa, sintering at 1"500°C for 3h. Soldering with Indium to backplate
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see General Comments
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_29569a22-72d9-3125-ba0d-ac7cf79adc1e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
